A4 利率冲击向净息差传导的阶段化动态响应算法（分阶段 Local Projection）
(*
Input:
r_t               : 利率变量（如DR007、7天期逆回购利率或1Y LPR）
nim_t             : 净息差序列（NIM，频率和年化口径固定）
stage_t           : 阶段标签（"Enter" / "Visible" / "Deep"）
Hmax              : 最大响应期数
pCtrl             : 控制变量滞后阶数
Xctrl_t           : 控制变量集合（可为空）
RateTransformRule : 冲击构造规则（"diff" / "logdiff" / 自定义函数；不重复差分）
ResponseRule      : 响应口径（"CumulativeChange" / "Level"）
ShockScale        : 冲击尺度（如0.001=10bp） CIflag            : 是否计算置信区间 CIlevel           : 置信区间水平 SEMode            : 标准误口径（"HAC" / "Cluster" / "BlockBootstrap"）
Output:
IRF[h,stage]      : 各阶段第h期动态响应
SE[h,stage]       : 稳健标准误
CI[h,stage]       : 置信区间
SampleDiag        : 各阶段、各预测期有效样本量*)
STEP 0. 数据变换与统一时间索引
ApplyRateTransform[s_, rule_] := Module[{out, offset}, If[rule == "diff",    out = Differences[s];      offset = 1];
If[rule == "logdiff", out = Differences[Log[s]]; offset = 1]; If[Head[rule] === Function, {out, offset} = rule[s]]; <|
"shock"->out,
"offset"->offset
|>]; ratePack = ApplyRateTransform[r_t, RateTransformRule]; shockUse = ratePack["shock"]; offset = ratePack["offset"]; Tmin = Min[Length[shockUse], Length[nim_t]-offset, Length[stage_t]-offset]; shockUse = shockUse[[1;; Tmin]]; nimUse = nim_t[[1 + offset;; offset + Tmin]]; stageUse = stage_t[[1 + offset;; offset + Tmin]]; XctrlUse = AlignControls[Xctrl_t, offset, Tmin];
STEP 1. 对每个预测期构造共同有效样本
Stages = {"Enter", "Visible", "Deep"};
IRF = Association[]; SE = Association[]; CI = Association[]; SampleDiag = Association[];
For[sIndex = 1, sIndex <= Length[Stages], sIndex++,
s = Stages[[sIndex]];
IRF[s] = Table[Missing[], {Hmax + 1}];
SE[s]  = Table[Missing[], {Hmax + 1}];
CI[s]  = Table[Missing[], {Hmax + 1}];
SampleDiag[s] = Table[0, {Hmax + 1}];
For[h = 0, h <= Hmax, h++,
tIdx = Range[Max[pCtrl + 1, 2], Tmin - h];
tIdx = Select[tIdx, stageUse[[#]] == s &];
If[ResponseRule == "CumulativeChange",
y = nimUse[[tIdx + h]] - nimUse[[tIdx - 1]], y = nimUse[[tIdx + h]]];
shock = shockUse[[tIdx]];
Zlag = BuildLagControls[shockUse, nimUse, XctrlUse, tIdx, pCtrl];
Z = Join[ConstantArray[{1}, Length[tIdx]], shock[[All, None]], Zlag, 2];
SampleDiag[s][[h + 1]] = Length[y];
If[Length[y] <= Dimensions[Z][[2]] + 2, Continue[]]; β = LeastSquares[Z, y]; resid = y - Z.β; IRF[s][[h + 1]] = β[[2]] * ShockScale; If[CIflag,
If[SEMode == "HAC",
Varβ = HACCovariance[Z, resid, Bandwidth -> Max[h, pCtrl]], Varβ = RobustCovariance[Z, resid, SEMode]];
SE[s][[h + 1]] = Sqrt[Varβ[[2,2]]] * ShockScale;
zCrit = Quantile[NormalDistribution[0,1], (1 + CIlevel)/2];
CI[s][[h + 1]] = {IRF[s][[h + 1]] - zCrit*SE[s][[h + 1]], IRF[s][[h + 1]] + zCrit*SE[s][[h + 1]]};
];
];
];
STEP 2. 结果解释边界
(*
若shockUse仅由利率变化构造，结果解释为“利率变动的条件动态响应”。
只有在使用可识别的外生政策意外或工具变量时，才解释为因果货币政策冲击响应。
阶段筛选始终保留真实时间索引，不将非连续阶段样本拼接为相邻观测。*)
OUTPUT PACK
Result = <|"IRF"->IRF, "SE"->If[CIflag,SE,None], "CI"->If[CIflag,CI,None], "SampleDiag"->SampleDiag|>;
A5 利率下行情景下商业银行盈利弹性测算算法（基于资产负债重定价的 NII / NIM / ROA / ROE 情景分析）
(*
Input:
ΔrSet          : 冲击绝对值集合（例如 {0.001,0.002} 对应10bp、20bp）
ShockDirection : "Down" / "Up"；算法内部统一冲击符号
BalanceSheet0  : 基准期资产负债表（平均生息资产、平均总资产、平均净资产等）
BucketA        : 资产分桶及余额、基准收益率、重定价日程、Beta、提前还款等
BucketL        : 负债分桶及余额、基准成本率、重定价日程、Beta、成本下限等
RepriceRuleA   : 资产端合同重定价和到期替换规则
RepriceRuleL   : 负债端重定价、存款下限和期限迁移规则
BetaRangeA     : 资产端传导系数区间
BetaRangeL     : 负债端传导系数区间
Horizon        : 情景作用期（以年表示，如0.25/0.5/1）
TaxRate        : 所得税率
OtherIncomeRule: 非息收入和费用联动规则
CapitalRule    : 权益固定或利润滚存规则
Unit           : 输出金额单位
Output:
ScenarioTable  : 不利、基准和有利情景下的ΔNII、ΔNIM、ΔROA、ΔROE
DetailTable    : 分桶贡献及重定价时间分解
PlotData       : 冲击大小与指标变化*)
STEP 0. 冲击符号和基准口径
SignedShock[x_] := If[ShockDirection == "Down", -Abs[x], Abs[x]];
AvgEA0 = BalanceSheet0["AvgEarningAssets"];
AvgA0  = BalanceSheet0["AvgTotalAssets"];
AvgE0  = BalanceSheet0["AvgEquity"];
NII0   = BalanceSheet0["NII"];
STEP 1. Horizon内重定价影响因子
RepriceImpactFactor[bucket_, Horizon_] := Module[{schedule, resetInterval, remainMat, effectiveReset}, schedule = Lookup[bucket, "RepriceSchedule", Missing[]];
If[schedule =!= Missing[],
Return[IntegrateRepricedBalanceShare[schedule, Horizon]]];
resetInterval = bucket["RepriceInterval"];
remainMat = bucket["RemainMat"];
effectiveReset = Min[resetInterval, remainMat];
(* 返回“重定价余额比例×重定价后在情景期内生效的平均年数”。 *)
ApproximateRepriceExposure[effectiveReset, Horizon, Lookup[bucket,"PrepayRate",0]]];
STEP 2. 单桶利率传导和利息金额变化
BetaAt[beta_, i_, n_] := If[VectorQ[beta] && Length[beta] == n, beta[[i]], beta];
BucketImpactA[Δr_, betaA_, Horizon_] := Module[{detail = {}, i, bal, factor, dRate, contrib}, For[i = 1, i <= Length[BucketA], i++, bal = BucketA[[i]]["Balance"];
factor = RepriceImpactFactor[BucketA[[i]], Horizon];
dRate = BetaAt[betaA, i, Length[BucketA]] * Δr;
contrib = bal * dRate * factor;
AppendTo[detail, <|"Bucket"->BucketA[[i]]["Name"], "ImpactFactor"->factor,
"Beta"->BetaAt[betaA, i, Length[BucketA]], "ΔYield"->dRate, "ΔIntIncome"->contrib|>];
];
<|"Sum"->Total[detail[[All,"ΔIntIncome"]]], "Detail"->detail|>];
BucketImpactL[Δr_, betaL_, Horizon_] := Module[{detail = {}, j, bal, factor, baseCost, floor, rawNew, newCost, dCost, contrib}, For[j = 1, j <= Length[BucketL], j++, bal = BucketL[[j]]["Balance"];
factor = RepriceImpactFactor[BucketL[[j]], Horizon];
baseCost = BucketL[[j]]["CostRate0"];
floor = Lookup[BucketL[[j]], "CostFloor", -Infinity];
rawNew = baseCost + BetaAt[betaL, j, Length[BucketL]]*Δr;
newCost = Max[rawNew, floor];
dCost = newCost - baseCost;
contrib = bal * dCost * factor;
AppendTo[detail, <|"Bucket"->BucketL[[j]]["Name"], "ImpactFactor"->factor,
"Beta"->BetaAt[betaL, j, Length[BucketL]], "CostFloor"->floor, "ΔCost"->dCost, "ΔIntExpense"->contrib|>];
];
<|"Sum"->Total[detail[[All,"ΔIntExpense"]]], "Detail"->detail|>];
STEP 3. 指标映射（金额为Horizon期内累计值）
MapToMetrics[ΔNII_, Horizon_] := Module[{ΔOther, ΔProfit, annualFactor, ΔNIM, ΔROA, ΔROE, E1}, ΔOther = ApplyOtherIncomeRule[OtherIncomeRule, ΔNII, Horizon];
ΔProfit = (ΔNII + ΔOther)*(1 - TaxRate);
annualFactor = 1/Horizon;
ΔNIM = ΔNII/AvgEA0 * annualFactor;
ΔROA = ΔProfit/AvgA0 * annualFactor;
If[CapitalRule == "EquityFixed",
ΔROE = ΔProfit/AvgE0 * annualFactor, E1 = AvgE0 + ΔProfit*(1 - BalanceSheet0["PayoutRatio"]);
ΔROE = (BalanceSheet0["Profit0"] + ΔProfit)/E1*annualFactor - BalanceSheet0["ROE"]];
ScaleUnit[<|"ΔNII"->ΔNII, "ΔNIM"->ΔNIM, "ΔROA"->ΔROA, "ΔROE"->ΔROE|>, Unit]];
STEP 4. 不利、基准和有利传导组合
betaA_low = BetaRangeA[[1]]; betaA_high = BetaRangeA[[2]];
betaL_low = BetaRangeL[[1]]; betaL_high = BetaRangeL[[2]];
ParamCases = {<|
"Tag"->"Adverse",
"betaA"->betaA_high,
"betaL"->betaL_low|>,
<|"Tag"->"Base",      "betaA"->Mean[BetaRangeA], "betaL"->Mean[BetaRangeL]|>,
<|"Tag"->"Favorable", "betaA"->betaA_low,         "betaL"->betaL_high|>};
(* 降息时，不利组合对应资产端传导快、负债端传导慢；有利组合方向相反。 *)
STEP 5. 主循环
ScenarioTable = Association[]; DetailTable = Association[]; PlotData = {};
For[s = 1, s <= Length[ΔrSet], s++,
Δr = SignedShock[ΔrSet[[s]]];
CaseOut = {}; CaseDetail = {};
For[c = 1, c <= Length[ParamCases], c++,
outA = BucketImpactA[Δr, ParamCases[[c]]["betaA"], Horizon];
outL = BucketImpactL[Δr, ParamCases[[c]]["betaL"], Horizon];
ΔNII = outA["Sum"] - outL["Sum"];
metrics = MapToMetrics[ΔNII, Horizon];
AppendTo[CaseOut, Join[<|"Δr"->Δr, "Case"->ParamCases[[c]]["Tag"]|>, metrics]];
AppendTo[CaseDetail, <|"Δr"->Δr, "Case"->ParamCases[[c]]["Tag"],
"AssetDetail"->outA["Detail"], "LiabDetail"->outL["Detail"]|>];
];
ScenarioTable[Δr] = CaseOut;
DetailTable[Δr] = CaseDetail;
baseRow = First@Select[CaseOut, #["Case"] == "Base" &];
AppendTo[PlotData, <|"Δr"->Δr, "ΔNIM"->baseRow["ΔNIM"], "ΔROE"->baseRow["ΔROE"]|>];
];
OUTPUT PACK
Result = <|"ScenarioTable"->ScenarioTable, "DetailTable"->DetailTable, "PlotData"->PlotData|>;
A6 约束状态驱动的商业银行大类资产配置与可行域评估算法（增量配置方向、三情景可行域与监管指标复核的统一框架）
ALGORITHM: NIM-State Robust Allocation Strategy Model
(Bandwidth + Increment Direction + Regime Learning + Bayesian Drift + Quantile Forecast + MPC + RL Weight Tuning)
I. INPUTS / OUTPUTS
INPUTS (public & reproducible; annual/quarter reports + public market rates):
T                    : time index (quarters or years), t = 1..|T|
# 时间粒度采用季度口径；年频口径的动态分辨率较低。
