YC_cred_t(m)       : high-grade credit curve by maturity (public)
# 用来构造“期限结构/利差/久期风险/资产收益proxy”，m是期限维度
Bank margin inputs (report):
rA_t               : avg earning-asset yield
rL_t               : avg interest-bearing liability cost
# 资产收益率和负债成本率按年报披露口径计算。
(optional) repricing proxies (report narratives/tables):
loan_reprice_proxy_t, deposit_reprice_proxy_t
# 可用“贷款重定价周期披露/存款定期化比例/结构性存款占比”等做proxy
