diagnostics:
feasibility flag, slacks, stability, sensitivity
# 用于输出“是否可行、余量多少、是否不稳定/过度敏感”
II. DEFINITIONS / MODEL OBJECTS
BUCKETS i=1..6: 1: Credit (loans) 2: Bond investments 3: Interbank & money-market assets 4: Trading & derivatives 5: Central bank & government-like assets 6: Wealth-management & fund-related investments (look-through proxy where feasible)
# 六大类资产需固定；第6类若无法穿透，用“理财/基金投向proxy+表外规模proxy”做近似
CONSTRAINTS:
- simplex: Σ_i w_i = 1  (or <=1 if you deliberately leave "other assets" blank)
# 年报映射未覆盖全部资产时，权重和采用 <=1 的留白口径。
- nonnegativity: w_i >= 0 - governance bands: w_min_base[i] <= w_i <= w_max_base[i]
- regulatory: CAR(w) >= CAR_bar, LCR(w) >= LCR_bar, NSFR(w) >= NSFR_bar - chance constraints (if enabled): q_δ(·) >= threshold
# 分位数约束把“最坏情形也过线”写进模型
STATE / PARAMETERS:
- NIM_t := rA_t - rL_t  (state variable)
# NIM 作为状态变量，连接 HMM、贝叶斯更新与约束强度。
- θ_t: elasticities controlling repricing and stickiness (drifting over time)
# 再定价弹性、成本黏性等参数随时间漂移
- λ_t: penalty weights (only tuned by RL, never directly output weights)
# RL只调λ/κ/cK等“惩罚参数”，不直接输出w或Δw
III. STEP 0. DEFINE MAPPING (REPORT → BUCKETS)
STEP 0.1  Define mapping rules:
Map reported balance-sheet/investment items to six buckets (traceable to notes/tables).
Ensure mapping is consistent across periods.
# 同一资产项跨期保持固定 bucket 映射，避免分类变化形成虚假波动。
STEP 0.2  Build data structures:
For each t:
store bucket stocks, weights w_{t-1}, available repricing/duration proxies if disclosed.
# 数据结构采用 DataFrame 或 Dict：{t: {A_t, w, rates, metrics, proxies}}。
IV. STEP 1. DATA INGESTION & CLEANING
FOR each t in T:
Load public rates:
LPR1_t, LPR5_t, DR007_t, YC_gov_t(m), YC_cred_t(m)
# 曲线可以用“关键期限点 + 插值”存储；后续久期/利差/斜率因子会用到
Load bank report data:
A_t, w_{t-1}, rA_t, rL_t
(if disclosed) CAR_t, LCR_t, NSFR_t
(optional) Π_nonint_t, Prov_t, C_t, Div_t, capital components
# 如果报表不披露NSFR细项，可直接用披露的NSFR值做“校准锚”，再用proxy映射权重变化
Validate: - align by quarter-end / year-end - handle missing market curve points by interpolation
- keep report series as reported (no smoothing unless explicitly defined) - check weight sum: Σ w_{t-1} <= 1 (allow blank "other assets" if designed)
# 市场数据可插值；报表数据原则上不平滑
V. STEP 2. NIM AS STATE VARIABLE (MECHANISM CORE)
STEP 2.1  Construct margin state:
NIM_t := rA_t - rL_t
# NIM 采用年报披露值或一致口径重算值，并进行交叉核对。
STEP 2.2  Liability cost mechanism with stickiness:
Define market-rate proxy:
r_mkt_t := DR007_t
# 资金市场成本锚：同业负债、存单发行、回购成本等
Define deposit cost proxy:
r_dep_t := deposit_reprice_proxy_t if available else infer from report cost components
# 存款成本proxy可用“存款利息支出/存款平均余额”或“计息负债成本率中存款部分”近似
Define market-based funding share proxy:
α_t := funding_mix_t (report-based) or stable proxy
# α_t反映“市场化负债占比”，占比越高，DR007传导越快越强
Liability cost:
rL_t := α_t * r_mkt_t + (1 - α_t) * r_dep_t
# 该式刻画存款成本对 DR007 的滞后传导。
STEP 2.3  Asset yield mechanism (bucket repricing):
Use weight vector w_{t} and bucket yields r_{i,t}:
rA_t := Σ_i w_{i,t} * r_{i,t}
# 资产端平均收益率由各bucket收益率加权形成（方向性表达）
Bucket yield specification (conceptual; can be estimated or scenario-set):
r_{i,t} = r̄_{i,t}+ β_i^LPR * ΔLPR_t+ β_i^M   * ΔDR007_t - ℓ_{i,t}
#
# - r̄_{i,t}: 基准收益（可从曲线/历史回归/年报收益分解近似）
# - β: 再定价弹性（后面Bayes更新）
# - ℓ: 损失/折价/流动性折扣（对交易/衍生品、信用类更重要）
Notes: - β and ℓ are not hard-coded assumptions; can be learned via Bayes module or set as scenario priors.
- This preserves non-linear/partial pass-through; avoids “funding ↓ implies deposit cost ↓ linearly”.
# 这里的关键是“不线性、不断言完全传导”，让机制更符合中国语境
VI. STEP 3. REGIME LEARNING + PARAMETER DRIFT + DISTRIBUTION FORECAST (OPTIONAL MODULES)
# These modules feed into constraints (chance constraints) and penalty weights (λ, κ, cK),
# but NEVER bypass Ω_t or governance constraints.
# 所有智能模块只影响“参数与预测”，不能改变约束集合Ω_t，更不能绕开监管阈值
------------------------------------------------------------
STEP 3A. HMM / Regime Learning (隐马尔可夫)
------------------------------------------------------------
IF HMM_state_module == ON:
Define regimes S = {1,2,3}: 1: "NIM controllable" (constraints implicit/loose) 2: "constraint becoming explicit" 3: "constraint hardening"
# 三阶段对应“息差可控—约束显性化—约束硬化”，用于解释带宽为何收缩
Construct observation vector y_t:
y_t := [NIM_t, ΔNIM_t, CAR_t (or proxy), LCR_t (or proxy), NSFR_t (or proxy), ΔRWA_proxy_t, Δw_proxy_t]
# 观测向量要能反映“息差变化+约束是否逼近+资产结构是否被动调整”
# ΔRWA_proxy可由RWA_int(w)变化近似；Δw_proxy可用||w_t - w_{t-1}||表示结构漂移
HMM specification:
s_t ∈ {1,2,3}
Transition: P(s_t=j | s_{t-1}=i) = p_ij Emission: y_t | s_t=j ~ Dist(·; φ_j)
# 发射分布可先用高斯/学生t；参数φ_j对应不同阶段的均值/方差结构
Fit / update HMM parameters (online or rolling window):
Estimate {p_ij, φ_j} using historical y_{1:t}
# 工程实现采用rolling window（如过去20~40个季度），避免结构突变导致参数失真
Infer regime probabilities (filtering):
γ_t(j) := P(s_t=j | I_t), j=1..3
# 用前向滤波得到当期阶段概率γ_t，后面用于“软调整”而非硬切换
Set regime label:
s_hat_t := argmax_j γ_t(j) Regime-aware adjustments (do NOT change hard constraints; only parameterize them):
- tighten δ_t if regime hardening probability high:
δ_t := f_δ(γ_t(3))      with δ_t ≤ δ_base
# 约束硬化概率高→更保守→用更小δ（更左尾）
- increase capital scarcity proxy when regime hardening:
cK_t := f_cK(γ_t(3))
# 资本越稀缺，资本占用惩罚越大（类似内生资本影子价格）
- adjust penalty weights baseline:
κ_LCR_t, κ_NSFR_t := f_κ(γ_t(2), γ_t(3))
# 在显性化/硬化阶段，流动性缺口惩罚要更强，避免逼线运行
ELSE:
Set:
γ_t(j) := fixed prior (e.g., [1,0,0]) s_hat_t := 1 δ_t := δ_base
# 不开HMM时，就当一直在阶段1（最宽松），但仍受监管硬约束
------------------------------------------------------------
STEP 3A-G. Conditional GAN Scenario Expansion（条件生成式情景扩展） ------------------------------------------------------------
IF Conditional_GAN_scenario_module == ON:
Define condition vector:
c_t := [γ_t(1), γ_t(2), γ_t(3), LPR1_t, LPR5_t, DR007_t, curve level/slope/curvature factors, credit spread and liquidity factors, NIM_t, CAR slack, LCR slack, NSFR slack]
Train or rolling-update conditional generator and discriminator:
G(z, c_t) -> future joint path ZPath^(b)
D(ZPath, c_t) -> probability of historical-consistent path
# 训练样本以真实日频/底层数据为主；低频监管指标不得机械复制成日频独立标签。
FOR b = 1,...,GANSpec.ScenarioNumber:
noise_b := DrawNoise[GANSpec.RandomSeed + b]
RawPath_b := G(noise_b, c_t)
ValidPath_b := EconomicConstraintCheck[RawPath_b, GANSpec.EconomicConstraintSet]
IF ValidPath_b == False:
Reject RawPath_b OR ProjectToAdmissibleScenarioSet[RawPath_b]
ELSE:
Store RawPath_b
END FOR
GANScenarioSet_t := TailReweight[StoredPaths, GANSpec.StressSamplingRatio, γ_t(3)] GeneratedScenarioSet_t := Union[HistoricalScenarioSet_t, RegulatoryStressSet_t, GANScenarioSet_t]
# GeneratedScenarioSet_t供Bayes/分位数预测、机会约束、MPC和安全RL训练环境调用。
# GAN不改变Ω_t、监管阈值和治理边界，也不直接生成配置权重。
ELSE:
GeneratedScenarioSet_t := Union[HistoricalScenarioSet_t, RegulatoryStressSet_t]
STEP 3B. Bayesian Learning (参数漂移：再定价弹性/成本黏性)
------------------------------------------------------------
IF Bayes_update_module == ON:
Define parameter vector θ_t including (example):
θ_t := {β_i^LPR (i=1..6), β_i^M   (i=1..6), stickiness parameters for r_dep transmission, optional: loss haircuts ℓ dynamics}
# θ_t 为机制参数，用于刻画利率变化对 NIM 与约束条件的影响。
State evolution (random walk, regime-dependent noise):
θ_t = θ_{t-1} + u_t u_t ~ N(0, Q_{s_hat_t})
# 参数漂移用随机游走；在阶段3可允许更大漂移（Q更大），反映机制不稳定
Observation equation (margin formation):
NIM_t = f(LPR1_t, LPR5_t, DR007_t, X_t; θ_t) + ε_t
ε_t ~ N(0, R)
# f(·)可以是线性状态空间，也可非线性但要可滤波；X_t是补充特征（负债结构、期限结构等）
Bayesian update:
p(θ_t | I_t) ∝ p(NIM_t | θ_t, I_{t-1}) · p(θ_{t-1} | I_{t-1})
# 工程实现上就是Kalman filter / particle filter / variational Bayes
Output:
posterior mean θ̂_t and posterior predictive distribution for:
NIM_{t+k}, k=1..H
# 输出未来 NIM 分布，供机会约束和情景校验调用。
ELSE:
Use fixed θ̂ (scenario priors) and deterministic NIM projections if needed.
# 不开Bayes时，β可用历史回归常数或情景设定
------------------------------------------------------------
STEP 3C. ML Quantile Forecast (条件分位数预测：NIM/CAR/LCR/NSFR)
------------------------------------------------------------
IF ML_quantile_module == ON:
Define target variables z in:
z ∈ {NIM, CAR, LCR, NSFR}
# 预测对象为关键约束指标的条件分布和分位数。
Define feature vector x_t:
x_t := [LPR1_t, LPR5_t, DR007_t, curve slope/level factors from YC_gov_t, YC_cred_t, funding mix proxies, bucket weights w_{t-1}, regime probabilities γ_t(·)]
# 特征既包含利率环境，也包含银行结构（w与负债结构），并把γ_t作为“阶段信息”
For each z and forecast horizon k=1..H: Train / update quantile model M_z,k,τ for τ ∈ {δ_t, 0.5, 1-δ_t} Examples: - Quantile Regression Forest - GBDT quantile model
# 工程上按期滚动更新或定期重训；τ要覆盖左尾/中位/右尾
Produce quantile forecasts:
q̂_τ(z_{t+k} | x_t), for τ ∈ {δ_t, 0.5, 1-δ_t}
ELSE:
Use simple scenario bands or Bayesian predictive only.------------------------------------------------------------
STEP 3D. Distribution Fusion (Bayes + ML) to support chance constraints
------------------------------------------------------------
IF (Bayes_update_module == ON) AND (ML_quantile_module == ON):
Define mixing weight ω_t depending on regime:
ω_t := f_ω(γ_t(1), γ_t(2), γ_t(3))
# 可设：阶段越稳定（γ1高）越信Bayes；阶段越硬化越信ML（抗结构突变）
For each z and k:
Construct fused distribution representation:
q̂_δ(z_{t+k}) := ω_t * q̂_δ^Bayes(z_{t+k}) + (1-ω_t) * q̂_δ^ML(z_{t+k}) (apply similarly for median/upper quantiles if needed)
# 这里用“分位数融合”是工程折中；更严格可用混合分布再取分位数（计算更重）
ELSE IF only one module available:
Use that module’s quantiles as q̂_δ(·).
VII. STEP 4. CONSTRAINT MAPPING (WEIGHTS → CAR/LCR/NSFR), FRONT-LOADED
Decision variables:
w_t (6x1)    : portfolio weights
Δw_t (6x1)   : incremental allocation for new assets
d (6x1)      : local direction vector (used inside solver)
# w是存量结构，Δw是新增结构，d是求解器内部的方向变量（之后会映射成Δw*）
------------------------------------------------------------
STEP 4.1 RWA intensity (proxy) ------------------------------------------------------------
RWA_int(w) := Σ_i w_i * ω_i ------------------------------------------------------------
STEP 4.2 LCR mapping (proxy) ------------------------------------------------------------
HQLA(w) := A_t * Σ_i w_i * h_i LCR(w)  := HQLA(w) / NCO_t where NCO_t is taken from report disclosure if possible, else use stable proxy consistent with disclosed LCR.
# NCO 细项缺失时，以披露 LCR 反推值作为校准锚。
------------------------------------------------------------
STEP 4.3 NSFR mapping (proxy) ------------------------------------------------------------
RSF(w)  := A_t * Σ_i w_i * r_i NSFR(w) := ASF_t / RSF(w) where ASF_t proxied from report NSFR disclosure or stable proxy.
# ASF同理：用披露NSFR反推ASF或用稳定资金结构proxy；关键是“权重变化→RSF变化”方向对
------------------------------------------------------------
STEP 4.4 CAR mapping (profit-capital-RWA chain; directional) ------------------------------------------------------------
Profit proxy:
π_t := NIM_t * A_t + Π_nonint_t - Prov_t - C_t Capital evolution proxy: K_t := K_{t-1} + π_t - Div_t
# 资本滚动用于把NIM状态与CAR约束联通起来（机制闭环）
CAR(w) := K_t / (A_t * RWA_int(w))
# CAR是方向性映射：权重变化主要通过RWA_int影响分母；更精细可加入资本内生补充机制
------------------------------------------------------------
STEP 4.5 Chance constraints (if enabled) ------------------------------------------------------------
IF (Bayes_update_module or ML_quantile_module) is ON:
For k=1..H:
Enforce conservative quantile constraints:
q̂_δt(CAR_{t+k}(w_{t+k}))  >= CAR_bar
q̂_δt(LCR_{t+k}(w_{t+k}))  >= LCR_bar
q̂_δt(NSFR_{t+k}(w_{t+k})) >= NSFR_bar
ELSE:
Use point constraints at t (or scenario-based stress) only:
CAR(w) >= CAR_bar
LCR(w) >= LCR_bar
NSFR(w) >= NSFR_bar ------------------------------------------------------------
STEP 4.6 Base feasibility constraints ------------------------------------------------------------
Simplex:
Σ_i w_i = 1   (or <=1 if “other assets blank” design is used)
Bounds:
w_i >= 0
w_min_base[i] <= w_i <= w_max_base[i]
Additional governance constraints (optional):
duration cap: Σ_i w_i * D_i <= D_cap
trading cap:  w_4 <= w4_cap
concentration caps, etc.
Define feasible set Ω_t accordingly.
VIII. STEP 5. OBJECTIVE: ROBUST MULTI-OBJECTIVE (USED FOR DIRECTION)
Define utility proxy U(w) for direction-finding (not claiming final optimum):
Expected return proxy:
E[R(w)] := Σ_i w_i * μ_i,t with μ_i,t computed from repricing + curve + haircut proxies Risk proxy using duration/DV01: D_p(w) := Σ_i w_i * D_i Var proxy := (D_p(w))^2 * Var(Δy)_t
# 这里用久期把利率风险粗入模（可解释、易落地）；Var(Δy)可用国债收益率波动proxy
Capital penalty:
Cap(w) := cK_t * RWA_int(w)
# 资本稀缺影子价格×RWA强度，体现“资本约束硬化”时资本占用更贵
Liquidity shortfall penalties:
Liq_LCR(w)  := κ_LCR_t  * max(0, LCR_bar  - LCR(w))^2 Liq_NSFR(w) := κ_NSFR_t * max(0, NSFR_bar - NSFR(w))^2 Liq(w) := Liq_LCR(w) + Liq_NSFR(w)
# 平方惩罚用于“逼线时非常痛”，让解自动远离红线（治理友好）
Utility:
U(w) := E[R(w)] - λ_var_t * Var_proxy(w) - λ_cap_t * Cap(w) - λ_liq_t * Liq(w) IX. STEP 6. STOCK–INCREMENT DUAL-TRACK (EXECUTABLE RULE) Asset growth: ΔA_t := g_t * A_{t-1} A_t  := A_{t-1} + ΔA_t Update rule: w_t = (A_{t-1}/A_t) * w_{t-1} + (ΔA_t/A_t) * Δw_t
# 关键执行口径：只配置增量ΔA_t，不动存量（避免频繁再平衡带来交易/估值/审批成本）
Interpretation: - w_{t-1} is inherited smoothly.- Only Δw_t steers new assets.
- Δw_t must satisfy same feasibility constraints (and practical step caps).
# Δw_t也应在同一Ω_t内（至少满足治理上限和非负），否则落地时会“增量指令不可执行”
X. STEP 7. CORE SOLVER: FEASIBLE REGION + BANDWIDTH + DIRECTION ------------------------------------------------------------
STEP 7.1 Anchor point ------------------------------------------------------------
Set:
w_anchor := w_{t-1}  (or observed current weights) If infeasible: Project: w_anchor := argmin_{w ∈ Ω_t} || w - w_{t-1} ||^2
# 如果当前结构已踩线（现实可能发生），先做最小调整投影回可行域，保证后续线性化有效
------------------------------------------------------------
STEP 7.2 Constraint vector g(w) and Jacobian J_g(w_anchor) ------------------------------------------------------------
Define inequality constraints g(w) <= 0:
g_CAR(w)   := CAR_bar  - CAR(w)
g_LCR(w)   := LCR_bar  - LCR(w)
g_NSFR(w)  := NSFR_bar - NSFR(w)
g_hi_i(w)  := w_i - w_max_base[i] g_lo_i(w)  := w_min_base[i] - w_i If chance constraints enabled: replace CAR(w), LCR(w), NSFR(w) with quantile-evaluated forms: CAR_qδ(w), LCR_qδ(w), NSFR_qδ(w) and define: g_CAR(w) := CAR_bar - CAR_qδ(w) etc.
# 这一步把“分位数约束”转成标准不等式，求解器才能统一处理
Equality constraint handled separately:
h(w) := Σ_i w_i - 1 = 0
# 等式约束用拉格朗日乘子ν处理；工程实现上可做“消元”或直接交给QP求解器
Linearize around anchor:
g(w_anchor + d) ≈ g(w_anchor) + J_g(w_anchor) * d
h(w_anchor + d) = 0 implies 1^T d = 0
# 线性近似以约束边界的一阶展开计算配置带宽。
------------------------------------------------------------
STEP 7.3 Local KKT/QP for feasible improvement direction d*------------------------------------------------------------
Compute gradient:
gradU := ∇U(w_anchor) Choose stability Hessian H (optional, PSD): H := εI  or approximate curvature proxy
# H用于稳定方向（防止梯度过激）；εI相当于“最小二乘正则”
Solve local QP:
maximize_d   gradU^T d - (1/2) d^T H d
subject to   g(w_anchor) + J_g d <= 0
1^T d = 0 ||d|| <= 1
# 这是“求方向而非求点”的关键：在不碰约束的前提下，找最优可行方向d*
Obtain:
d*            : normalized direction (6x1)
μ             : multipliers for active inequality constraints
ν             : multiplier for equality (sum-to-one)
Active set A  : constraints with nonzero μ
Define reported shadow prices:
μ_CAR := multiplier attached to g_CAR μ_LCR := multiplier attached to g_LCR μ_NSFR := multiplier attached to g_NSFR
# μ就是“解释力”：μ_LCR大说明LCR最紧；μ_CAR大说明资本约束在硬化
------------------------------------------------------------
STEP 7.4 Boundary hit: maximum step length η_max along d*------------------------------------------------------------
Compute:
η_max := +∞ binding_report := empty FOR each inequality constraint j: denom := (J_g_j * d*) IF denom > 0: η_j := (- g_j(w_anchor)) / denom IF η_j < η_max: η_max := η_j binding_report := {j} ELSE IF η_j == η_max: binding_report := binding_report ∪ {j}
# η_max是“沿d*走到第一个约束碰线”为止的距离 = 局部边界命中（线性近似）
Boundary point (local approximation):
w_boundary := w_anchor + η_max * d*
# 这是局部边界点，可用于画“可行域收缩/边界命中”示意图
------------------------------------------------------------
STEP 7.5 Convert direction d* into incremental allocation Δw*_t ------------------------------------------------------------
Baseline:
Δw*_t := normalize_to_simplex(d* + base_increment_prior) (if you want pure direction: use Δw*_t := simplex_projection(d*))
# d*是方向，不一定在单纯形；需要投影/归一化成可执行的Δw（非负、和为1）
Apply practical step caps:
Δw*_t := clip(Δw*_t, Δw_min, Δw_max) Ensure simplex: Δw*_t := project_to_simplex(Δw*_t)
# Δw_min/max是“增量层面”的操作限额（比如单季某类资产新增占比不能超过x%）
Store:
η_max and binding_report for explanation.
XI. STEP 8. BANDWIDTH COMPUTATION (REPORT MODE + HARD MODE) ------------------------------------------------------------
MODE A: Convex QP scan (deliverable-style) ------------------------------------------------------------
FOR each asset i in {1..6}:
# Lower bound:
Solve:
minimize_w    w_i + ρ ||w - w_anchor||^2
subject to    w ∈ Ω_t
Set:
w_lower[i] := solution w_i
# Upper bound:
Solve:
maximize_w    w_i - ρ ||w - w_anchor||^2
subject to    w ∈ Ω_t
Set:
w_upper[i] := solution w_i Compute: width[i] := w_upper[i] - w_lower[i]
# Mode A最适合出“表格交付件”：每类资产上下限+宽度；ρ用于避免其他维度乱跳
------------------------------------------------------------
MODE B: Linear boundary approximation + multipliers (面对装懂的人) ------------------------------------------------------------
Use active set A and linearization:
Feasible direction cone near anchor:
J_A d <= 0
1^T d = 0
# 只用“活跃约束”描述局部可行方向锥，强调“边界是哪些约束构成的”
For each i:
Solve small LP/QP to find marginal room:
d_i^+ := argmax d_i subject to J_A d <= 0, 1^T d = 0, ||d||_1 <= 1
d_i^- := argmin d_i subject to same constraints
Convert marginal direction to weight bounds via η limits:
w_upper[i] ≈ w_anchor[i] + η_plus[i] * d_i^+
w_lower[i] ≈ w_anchor[i] + η_minus[i] * d_i^-
Additionally compute KKT-adjusted marginal score:
shadow_i := ∂U/∂w_i - Σ_{j∈A} μ_j * ∂g_j/∂w_i
# shadow_i是“净边际价值”：收益梯度减去约束影子成本；用于解释为什么推不动/该推谁
Interpret: - sign(shadow_i) suggests push up/down - largest μ_j indicates which constraint blocks movement
XII. STEP 9. DIAGNOSTICS & GOVERNANCE OUTPUT
Compute slacks at anchor:
slack_CAR  := CAR(w_anchor)  - CAR_bar slack_LCR  := LCR(w_anchor)  - LCR_bar slack_NSFR := NSFR(w_anchor) - NSFR_bar
# 余量slack是领导最爱看的：离红线还有多少
Feasibility:
feasible := (all slacks >= 0 and bounds satisfied)
Stability flags: - if Ω_t empty -> revise proxy inputs / relax δ_t / widen governance bands
- if most widths collapse -> constraint hardening regime warning
# Ω_t 为空时返回不可行诊断，并复核代理参数、约束一致性和治理区间。
Produce outputs:
Table:
i, w_anchor[i], w_lower[i], w_upper[i], width[i], main_binding_constraint
Vector:
Δw*_t, η_max
Shadow prices:
μ_CAR, μ_LCR, μ_NSFR
Regime:
s_hat_t, γ_t(·)
XIII. STEP 10. MPC (ROLLING CONTROL) + RL WEIGHT TUNING (OPTIONAL) ------------------------------------------------------------
STEP 10A. MPC module (roll horizon, execute first step only)
------------------------------------------------------------
IF MPC_module == ON:
At time t, define horizon k=0..H: Decision sequence: {Δw_{t|t}, Δw_{t+1|t}, ..., Δw_{t+H|t}} State predictions: distributions for {NIM, CAR, LCR, NSFR} over horizon
# MPC的“重”在于每期滚动预测H期，但只执行第一期；其余作为前瞻约束
Build MPC objective over horizon:
maximize  E[ Σ_{k=0..H} β^k U(w_{t+k|t}) ]
subject to:
stock–increment update:
w_{t+k|t} = (A_{t+k-1|t}/A_{t+k|t}) w_{t+k-1|t}+ (ΔA_{t+k|t}/A_{t+k|t}) Δw_{t+k|t}
chance constraints across horizon:
q̂_δt(CAR_{t+k|t})  >= CAR_bar, ∀k
q̂_δt(LCR_{t+k|t})  >= LCR_bar, ∀k
q̂_δt(NSFR_{t+k|t}) >= NSFR_bar, ∀k
governance bands and simplex constraints ∀k
# MPC的价值：避免“当前可行但未来撞线”；尤其适合低利率阶段约束快速硬化
Solve MPC optimization:
obtain optimal sequence Δw*_{t:t+H|t}
Execute only first step:
Δw*_t := Δw*_{t|t} Advance: t := t+1, re-ingest new data, repeat.ELSE: Use single-period solver (Step 7/8) for Δw*_t and bandwidth.------------------------------------------------------------
STEP 10B. RL module (ONLY tunes penalty weights λ; never outputs weights)
------------------------------------------------------------
IF RL_tuning_module == ON:
Define RL state sRL_t:
sRL_t := [γ_t(1), γ_t(2), γ_t(3), NIM_t, CAR_t, LCR_t, NSFR_t, bandwidth widths summary, recent constraint violations / near-miss indicators]
# RL状态要反映“阶段+逼线程度+带宽收缩”，这样RL调参才有意义
Define RL action a_t:
a_t := adjustments to penalty weights (bounded): λ_var_t, λ_cap_t, λ_liq_t, κ_LCR_t, κ_NSFR_t, cK_t with hard bounds to preserve governance: λ_min <= λ <= λ_max
# 需加上下限/上限，防止RL把权重调到极端导致解不稳定或过度保守
Define reward r_t (governance-consistent):
r_t := ProfitProxy_t - penalty_violation * (indicator of CAR/LCR/NSFR breach or near-breach) - penalty_instability * turnover_proxy(Δw*_t) - penalty_vol * risk_proxy(w_t)
# reward需把“合规/稳定性”写进负奖励，否则RL会受收益目标驱动逼线甚至越线
RL update rule:
update policy π(a | sRL) to maximize E[Σ ρ^k r_{t+k}]
# 方法可选（PPO/DDPG/Q-learning），但输出只能是惩罚参数
Apply RL output ONLY as parameters for next solve:
(λ_var_t, λ_cap_t, λ_liq_t, κ_LCR_t, κ_NSFR_t, cK_t) := policy(sRL_t) IMPORTANT GOVERNANCE: - RL never modifies Ω_t constraints.- RL never directly produces w_t or Δw_t.- RL only tunes penalty weights used inside U(w) and shortfall penalties.
# 治理边界：RL 仅调节惩罚权重，不修改硬约束或直接生成资产权重。
ELSE:
Keep penalty weights fixed or regime-adjusted via γ_t only.
XIV. MAIN LOOP (END-TO-END EXECUTION)
INITIALIZE:
Set initial w_0 from report mapping.
Set baseline penalties λ_0, κ_0, δ_base, cK_0.
Initialize optional module states:
HMM parameters, Bayesian priors, ML models, RL policy.
# 初始化要把“口径映射、参数先验、模型缓存”准备好，集中存放于 Config 对象
FOR each t in T:
1) Ingest data (STEP 1)
2) Build NIM state & repricing mechanism (STEP 2)
3) Optional: HMM regime probabilities γ_t (STEP 3A)
4) Optional: Bayesian parameter update θ_t (STEP 3B)
5) Optional: ML quantile forecasts (STEP 3C)
6) Fuse distributions & set δ_t (STEP 3D)
7) Optional: RL tunes λ_t, κ_t, cK_t based on sRL_t (STEP 10B)
8) Build constraints Ω_t with chance constraints if enabled (STEP 4)
9) Solve:
IF MPC ON: solve MPC and execute first Δw*_t (STEP 10A)
ELSE: compute local KKT direction + bandwidth (STEP 7/8)
10) Update weights using dual-track rule (STEP 6)
11) Produce governance outputs, shadow prices, binding report (STEP 9)
# 执行顺序：学习与预测、构造 Ω_t、更新惩罚参数、求解配置。
END FOR
END ALGORITHM
A7 外部利率阶段识别与 NIM 内部校准算法（7天期逆回购利率、1Y LPR、DR007、10Y国债收益率与NIM联合判定）
(
Input:
Repo7D_t      : 人民银行7天期逆回购利率序列
LPR1_t        : 1 年期 LPR 序列
DR007_t       : DR007 季度均值及波动指标
Y10_t         : 10 年期国债收益率季度均值及波动指标
NIM_t         : 银行净息差序列
PersistK      : 阶段持续期要求
StageRef      : 4%、3%、2%、1%、0%及负利率阶段参考区间
WeightSet     : 外部利率信号权重，权重和为 1
Output:
RateStage_t   : 外部利率阶段标签
NIMState_t    : 内部经营状态
Divergence_t  : 外部环境与内部经营结果偏离标记
Scenario_t    : 下行、波动或压力切换情景
SwitchFlag_t  : 阶段切换信号)
STEP 0. 数据频率对齐
Repo7D_q = QuarterEnd[Repo7D_t];
LPR1_q   = QuarterEnd[LPR1_t];
DR007_q = <|"Mean"->QuarterMean[DR007_t], "Vol"->QuarterVol[DR007_t]|>;
Y10_q   = <|"Mean"->QuarterMean[Y10_t], "Vol"->QuarterVol[Y10_t]|>;
NIM_q   = AnnualizeAndAlign[NIM_t];
# 高频利率聚合至季度，NIM 统一年化口径。
STEP 1. 单指标阶段映射
Stage_Repo = MapToStage[Repo7D_q, StageRef["Repo7D"]];
Stage_LPR  = MapToStage[LPR1_q, StageRef["LPR1"]];
Stage_DR   = MapToStage[DR007_q["Mean"], StageRef["DR007"]];
Stage_Y10  = MapToStage[Y10_q["Mean"], StageRef["Y10"]];
NIMState_t = MapToState[NIM_q, StageRef["NIM"]];
# 参考区间采用正文表 9-7 的管理口径。
STEP 2. 外部利率阶段合成
StageScore_t = WeightSet["Repo"]*Stage_Repo + WeightSet["LPR"]*Stage_LPR + WeightSet["DR"]*Stage_DR + WeightSet["Y10"]*Stage_Y10;
RateStageRaw_t = NearestStage[StageScore_t];
RateStage_t = PersistenceFilter[RateStageRaw_t, PersistK];
# 7天期逆回购利率为政策锚，DR007校准货币市场运行，LPR反映贷款定价阶段，10年期国债收益率校准长端环境。
STEP 3. NIM 内部校准与偏离识别
Divergence_t = NIMState_t - ExpectedNIMState[RateStage_t];  # 状态值越大表示经营压力越高
IF Abs[Divergence_t] <= Tolerance: InternalFlag_t = "Matched";
IF Divergence_t >  Tolerance: InternalFlag_t = "PressureAhead";
IF Divergence_t < -Tolerance: InternalFlag_t = "BufferAvailable";
# NIM 校准经营压力，不覆盖外部利率阶段标签。
STEP 4. 情景切换
Scenario_t = "Baseline";
IF StageDown[RateStage_t] AND NIMPressureUp[NIMState_t]:
Scenario_t = "PressureSwitch";
ELSE IF VolUp[DR007_q["Vol"]] OR VolUp[Y10_q["Vol"]]:
Scenario_t = "Volatility";
ELSE IF TrendDown[Repo7D_q] OR TrendDown[LPR1_q] OR TrendDown[Y10_q["Mean"]]:
Scenario_t = "Downward";
SwitchFlag_t = ConfirmByPersistence[Scenario_t, PersistK];
OUTPUT PACK
Result = <|"RateStage"->RateStage_t, "NIMState"->NIMState_t, "Divergence"->Divergence_t, "Scenario"->Scenario_t, "SwitchFlag"->SwitchFlag_t|>;
A8 风险调整后收益与资本占用效率辅助诊断算法（RORAC、RORWA 与相对排序）
(
Input:
BucketSet       : 六大类资产及关键二类资产集合
Income_i        : 利息、票息、交易和服务收入（若已扣除减值损失需标记）
IncomeIncludesImpairment_i : Income_i是否已包含减值损失
Exposure_i      : 资产暴露余额
RiskClass_i, Duration_i : 经济资本代理所需风险类别与期限
FundingCost_i   : FTP 资金成本及期限、流动性成本
OpCost_i        : 运营与管理成本
EL_i            : 预期损失或审慎代理值
RWA_i           : 风险加权资产或公开口径代理值
EconCapital_i   : 经济资本；缺失时采用区间代理
Liquidity_i     : HQLA价值、LCR影响、RSF占用和流动性成本的分项指标
Customer_i      : 客户综合贡献
DataFlag_i      : 披露值、测算值或估算值标记
Output:
RORAC_i         : 风险调整后资本收益率区间
RORWA_i         : 单位风险加权资产收益率区间
CapitalIntensity_i : 资本占用强度
DirectionIndex_i   : 相对配置方向指数
RankTable       : 资产相对排序与边界说明)
STEP 0. 数据性质标记
For each i in BucketSet:
Record DataFlag_i ∈ {"Disclosed", "Calculated", "Estimated"};
Build Low/Base/High parameter bands for unavailable items;
# 公开数据不足的项目采用区间估算，并保留数据性质标记。
STEP 1. 风险调整后净收益
ELAdj_i = If[IncomeIncludesImpairment_i, 0, EL_i];  NetRAR_i = Income_i - FundingCost_i - OpCost_i - ELAdj_i;
STEP 2. RORWA 与 RORAC
IF RWA_i > RWAEpsilon: RORWA_i = NetRAR_i/RWA_i; ELSE: RORWA_i = NotApplicable["RWA接近零"];
IF EconCapital_i is available:
RORAC_i = NetRAR_i / EconCapital_i;
ELSE:
EconCapitalBand_i = CapitalProxy[RWA_i, RiskClass_i, Duration_i, Liquidity_i];
RORAC_i = Interval[NetRAR_i / EconCapitalBand_i];
CapitalIntensity_i = RWA_i / Exposure_i;
STEP 3. 相对指数标准化
RORWAIndex_i = If[ApplicableQ[RORWA_i], 100*RORWA_i/RORWA_AllBank, NotApplicable[]];
RORACIndex_i = 100 * RORAC_i / RORAC_AllBank;
CapitalIndex_i = 100 * CapitalIntensity_i / CapitalIntensity_AllBank;
DirectionIndex_i = RankBy[StandardizeComparable[{RORACIndex_i, RORWAIndex_i, -CapitalIndex_i, Liquidity_i, Customer_i}], ExcludeNotApplicable -> True];
# 指数用于相对排序，硬约束仍由 CAR、CET1、LCR、NSFR 和风险限额确定。
STEP 4. 方向识别
IF RORACIndex_i high AND RORWAIndex_i high AND CapitalIndex_i acceptable:
Action_i = "IncreaseOrMaintain";
IF return adequate BUT capital/liquidity consumption high:
Action_i = "RepriceOrRestructure";
IF risk compensation insufficient OR migration deteriorates:
Action_i = "ReduceOrExit";
OUTPUT PACK
Result = <|
"RORAC"->RORAC_i,
"RORWA"->RORWA_i,
"CapitalIntensity"->CapitalIntensity_i,
"DirectionIndex"->DirectionIndex_i,
"Action"->Action_i,
"DataFlag"->DataFlag_i|>;
A9 存量资产四类池与新增资源五道准入闸门（存量迁移、二类资产清单与增量准入）
(
Input:
AssetList       : 存量资产和拟新增资产清单
FTPNetReturn_j  : FTP 后净收益
RORAC_j, RORWA_j, RWAIntensity_j
CashFlow_j, Duration_j, NSFRUse_j, Liquidity_j
EL_j, Migration_j, ValuationVol_j, Concentration_j
CustomerValue_j : 结算、存款、托管、承销、财富管理和综合收入贡献
ThresholdSet    : 收益、资本、流动性、风险与客户价值门槛
Output:
StockPool_j     : 稳定持有池、重估优化池、压降置换池或退出处置池
TierList_j      : 优先配置名单、观察复核名单或压降退出名单
GateResult_j    : 五道闸门逐项结果
Action_j        : 续作、重定价、缩期、置换、压降或退出)
STEP 1. 存量资产四类池
IF CashFlow stable AND return covers cost AND risk controlled AND CustomerValue strong:
StockPool_j = "StableHold";
ELSE IF repair potential exists AND asset quality acceptable:
StockPool_j = "RevalueOptimize";
ELSE IF compensation insufficient OR NSFRUse high OR Migration rising:
StockPool_j = "ReduceReplace";
ELSE IF cash flow deteriorates AND return fails to cover risk and capital cost:
StockPool_j = "ExitDispose";
STEP 2. 重点二类资产分层清单
IF risk compensation weak OR capital efficiency low:
TierList_j = "ReduceExit";
ELSE IF DirectionIndex_j high AND all limits available:
TierList_j = "Priority";
ELSE:
TierList_j = "Review";
IF TierList_j == "Review" AND no improvement for ReviewPeriods:
TierList_j = "ReduceExit";
IF TierList_j == "ReduceExit" AND compensation, customer value and capital efficiency recover:
TierList_j = "Review";
STEP 3. 新增资源五道准入闸门
Gate1_Return     = FTPNetReturn_j covers funding, operating and management costs;
Gate2_Capital    = RORAC_j and RORWA_j meet internal requirements;
Gate3_Liquidity  = NSFRUse_j, duration and stress cash flow remain acceptable;
Gate4_Risk       = EL_j, Migration_j, valuation risk and concentration remain within limits;
Gate5_StrategicOperational = If[CustomerSuitabilityApplicable_j, CustomerValue_j identifiable AND product suitability adequate, LegalCompliance_j AND DataValuationCapability_j];
GateResult_j = {Gate1_Return, Gate2_Capital, Gate3_Liquidity, Gate4_Risk, Gate5_StrategicOperational};
STEP 4. 执行动作
FailedGates_j = Pick[{"Return","Capital","Liquidity","Risk","StrategicOperational"}, Not /@ GateResult_j];
IF FailedGates_j == {}:
Action_j = {"ApproveAndAllocate"};
ELSE:
Action_j = MapGateFailureToActions[FailedGates_j];
# 多道闸门同时失败时并列输出全部整改动作，不由第一条ELSE IF覆盖其余问题。
OUTPUT PACK
Result = <|"StockPool"->StockPool_j, "TierList"->TierList_j, "GateResult"->GateResult_j, "Action"->Action_j|>;
A10 回测、触发与滚动校准算法（外部利率、经营结果与约束边界三类信号）
(
Input:
AllocationPlan_t : 配置区间、增量方向和存量迁移计划
ActualResult_t   : 实际资产结构、收益、资本、流动性、风险和协同指标
ExternalSignal_t : LPR、DR007、10 年期国债收益率、收益率曲线和市场波动
OperatingSignal_t: NIM、利息净收入、手续费收入和负债成本
ConstraintSignal_t: CET1、CAR、LCR、NSFR、久期、估值、保证金、迁徙和声誉风险
TriggerSet       : 正文或内部管理口径设定的触发阈值
ReviewCycle      : 年度、季度、月度和日常触发频率
Output:
BacktestTable    : 计划值、实际值与偏差归因
TriggerLevel     : 正常、关注、预警或压力
CorrectionAction : 增量重排、存量迁移、FTP 调整、风险预算调整和安全底座补充
ParameterUpdate  : HMM、贝叶斯、分位数预测、MPC 和 RL 参数更新)
STEP 1. 多维回测
BacktestDimension = {Return, Capital, Liquidity, StableFunding, Risk, Valuation, Collaboration, CustomerValue};
For each d in BacktestDimension:
Deviation_d = ActualResult_t[d] - AllocationPlan_t[d];
Attribution_d = AttributeTo{AssetSupply, Execution, RateChange, CapitalTightening, LiquidityTightening, RiskMigration};
STEP 2. 三类触发信号
ExternalFlag  = Evaluate[ExternalSignal_t, TriggerSet["External"]];
OperatingFlag = Evaluate[OperatingSignal_t, TriggerSet["Operating"]];
ConstraintFlag= Evaluate[ConstraintSignal_t, TriggerSet["Constraint"]];
IF AnyHardLimitBreached[ConstraintSignal_t, TriggerSet["HardConstraint"]]: TriggerLevel = "Pressure"; ELSE: TriggerLevel = AggregateSeverity[ExternalFlag, OperatingFlag, ConstraintFlag];
# 具体阈值沿用正文或内部管理口径，算法层不新增数值。
STEP 3. 纠偏动作映射
IF NIM pressure rises: Reduce low-efficiency assets; increase stable coupon and service income contribution;
IF capital pressure rises: Raise RORAC threshold; control high-RWA assets;
IF NSFR pressure rises: Control high-RSF and long-duration assets; increase stable deposits or longer-term funding;
IF market risk rises: Shorten duration; reduce DV01 and directional exposure; strengthen hedging;
IF credit migration rises: Tighten sector limits; move assets to Watch/ReduceExit lists;
IF collaboration income weakens: Adjust product and customer service mix;
STEP 4. 运行节奏
Annual: set risk appetite, allocation bands, capital budget, liquidity floor and collaboration targets;
Quarterly: review rate stage, NIM, CET1, CAR, LCR, NSFR, duration gap and allocation deviation;
Monthly: update new-asset admission, stock migration, low-efficiency warnings, limits and FTP curve;
DailyTrigger: monitor market, liquidity, valuation and limit signals; escalate material events, while full allocation-band re-optimization remains monthly/quarterly;
STEP 5. 参数与计划更新
Propose HMM transition and stage-probability updates after data-quality and stability checks;
Propose Bayesian/Kalman parameter updates after out-of-sample validation;
Retrain or recalibrate quantile forecasts when forecast error exceeds tolerance;
Update MPC state and execute the first-period correction;
Update RL penalty weights only after independent validation, governance approval and rollback readiness;
AllocationPlan_{t+1} = ReSolve[A6, UpdatedInputs];
Backtest uses only data and parameter versions available at each historical decision date; full-sample smoothed states are excluded from real-time backtest signals.
OUTPUT PACK
Result = <|"Backtest"->BacktestTable, "TriggerLevel"->TriggerLevel, "CorrectionAction"->CorrectionAction, "ParameterUpdate"->ParameterUpdate|>;
